parent: pm-beads-dt52
close_reason: throw on no-arg/read-failure + throw when all lines failed. Verified exit 1 for missing-file/no-arg/fully-malformed; partial stays exit 0.
body: "Bug class #4 (wrong exit code). Failure paths returned { error } -> host exit 0; also a fully-malformed JSONL imported 0 yet exited 0.\nRepro (before fix):\n  pm beads import /tmp/nope.jsonl ; echo $? -> 0\n  pm beads import ; echo $?              -> 0\n  pm beads import bad.jsonl ; echo $?    -> 0 (every line unparseable)\nExpected: non-zero.\nFix: throw on no-arg and read failure; throw when imported===0 && skipped>0 (whole file failed). Partial imports stay lenient (exit 0).\nVerified: missing-file/no-arg/fully-malformed all exit 1; 1-good-1-bad exits 0."
